request.description:
Get authenticated user info menggunakan access token.

**Auth:** Bearer Token (auto dari collection variable)

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "user": {
      "id": "...",
      "username": "...",
      "name": "...",
      "email": "...",
      "role": "..."
    }
  }
}
```

**[ADMIN ONLY]** Get all active sessions from all users.

**Query Params:**
- `limit`: Number of sessions (default: 20)

**Response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": {
    "total_active_sessions": 150,
    "sessions": [...]
  }
}
```
